sol:'For each charge element $dq$ at one rim point, the diametric partner contributes an equal-opposite field vector; summing over the whole ring annihilates the total. The axial formula $E(x) = Qx/(4\\pi\\varepsilon_0(x^{2}+R^{2})^{3/2})$ confirms it: $E(0) = 0$.',
