sol:'Bring $q_2$ from infinity through the potential of $q_1$: $U = q_2 V_1(r) = q_1 q_2/(4\\pi\\varepsilon_0 r)$ — sign carried by the charges themselves: like signs store positive energy (bound to fly apart), opposite signs negative (bound to stay).',
