sol:'First charge free; second works against one field: $kq^{2}/a$; third against two: $2kq^{2}/a$. Total $U = 3 \\cdot \\frac{q^{2}}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0 a}$ — simply the sum over the $\\binom{3}{2} = 3$ pairs. Assembly energy always enumerates PAIRS, not charges.',
